<title>UK: Denmark sets 500 million mark five-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Denmark sets 500 million mark five-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager HSBC Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DENMARK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    07.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.30    PAY DATE    07.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.55     SPREAD	+22 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/DE</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND OBL 120</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
